      "text": "1. The Board established by the said  \nExecutive Order 9387 is hereby re-estab­\nlished to serve for a period of sixty days,  \nor for such shorter period of time as may  \nbe required for the completion of its  \nfunctions, for the limited purpose of es­\ntablishing fair and equitable standards,  \nrules, and formulae of general applica­\nbility for the guidance of the War Ship­\nping Administration in determining the  \njust compensation to be paid for all ves­\nsels requisitioned pursuant to the act of  \nJune 6, 1941, 55 Stat. 242."
    },
